<title>POLAND: Kredyt Bank Q4 net rises to PLN 6.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Kredyt Bank Q4 net rises to PLN 6.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kredyt Bank results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			 10.81 vs   4.38</p>
<p>    net					   6.18 vs   2.17</p>
<p>    pre-tax				    10.80 vs   4.38</p>
<p>    revenues from securities		0.0  vs   0.0</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues	77.14 vs  49.04</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	   45.42 vs  34.73</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	     14.09 vs   6.72</p>
<p>    costs of commission		     1.15 vs   0.34</p>
<p>    income tax				  4.62 vs   2.21</p>
<p>    other taxes				 0.0  vs   0.0</p>
<p>    extraordinary			     0.0  vs   0.0</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit			 40.50 vs  21.37</p>
<p>    net					  23.21 vs  10.32</p>
<p>    pre-tax				    40.51 vs  21.36</p>
<p>    revenues from securities		0.58 vs   0.27</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues     252.10 vs 174.99</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	  157.28 vs 121.34</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	     43.31 vs  20.59</p>
<p>    costs of commission		     1.98 vs   1.47</p>
<p>    income tax				 17.30 vs  11.05</p>
<p>    extraordinary			     0.01 vs   0.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Kredyt Bank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
